      "slug": "DALPHIN",
      "title": "DALPHIN",
      "description": "DALPHIN is a multicentric, open visual question answering (VQA) benchmark for pathology AI copilots. It focuses on assessing multimodal large language models across a range of diagnostic reasoning tasks using histopathology images (thumbnails and regions of interest) derived from whole-slide images. The benchmark comprises 300 cases collected from six healthcare institutions in six countries, covering 130 diagnoses across 14 pathology subspecialties, including non-neoplastic entities and rare cancers. DALPHIN provides a standardized, long-term framework for reproducible, automated evaluation and enables direct comparison of pathology AI assistants both among themselves and against pathologists with different levels of expertise.",
